### Verification Summary

1. **Consistent single-repository implementation (`lambdaclass/concrete` only, no fallback or dual-remote path):**
   - [`scripts/land/train.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/train.sh#L176-L209): `REPO` defaults to `lambdaclass/concrete` and `REMOTE` to `origin`. [`github_slug`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/train.sh#L194-L200) and [`check_remote`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/train.sh#L201-L209) require `$REMOTE` to be configured and fail closed if its GitHub URL resolves to any repository other than `$REPO` (refusing `unbalancedparentheses/concrete2` or any other GitHub slug). [`cmd_land`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/train.sh#L984-L1028) pushes `refs/heads/main` only to `$REMOTE` via [`push_retry`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/train.sh#L221-L237), verifies the remote SHA with `git ls-remote`, and removes `LAND_MIRROR` and `mirror_url` completely.
   - [`scripts/land/signoff.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/signoff.sh#L34-L45) and [`scripts/push-both.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/push-both.sh#L40-L79) enforce the same `github_slug` check against `lambdaclass/concrete` and remove all secondary-remote pushing.
   - [`scripts/land/acceptance.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/acceptance.sh#L189-L335) rehearses landing against `origin` only, with `LAND_MIRROR` and `lambdaclass.git` removed.
   - [`scripts/oracle/ORACLE.lock`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/oracle/ORACLE.lock#L32-L34) and [`scripts/oracle/build.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/oracle/build.sh#L106-L114) point `release_repo` and `artifact_url` to `lambdaclass/concrete` and verify that the lock's `artifact_url` equals `https://github.com/$RREPO/releases/download/$RTAG/$ANAME` (matching P5 in [`scripts/land/legacy_move.sh`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/scripts/land/legacy_move.sh#L158-L159)).
   - [`.github/workflows/lean_action_ci.yml`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/.github/workflows/lean_action_ci.yml#L60-L64), [`.claude/commands/land.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/.claude/commands/land.md#L21-L45), [`AGENTS.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/AGENTS.md#L96-L103), [`README.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/README.md#L54-L62), [`docs/LANDING.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/docs/LANDING.md#L50-L51), [`docs/REVIEW.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/docs/REVIEW.md#L54), [`docs/SELF_HOSTED_RUNNERS.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/docs/SELF_HOSTED_RUNNERS.md#L56-L59), and [`docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md`](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/rev-so-b/src/docs/proposals/SPEC_UNIFICATION.md#L1207-L1213) consistently name `lambdaclass/concrete` (`origin`) as the one repository.

